          <div class="info-stat"><span class="info-stat-label">Today</span><span class="info-stat-val">Sarvodaya groups descended from the networks of Vinoba Bhave still work locally in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/india">India</a>; the journal <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mahatma-gandhi">Gandhi</a> Marg has been published since 1957 by the Gandhi Peace Foundation; Gandhian methods are cited in civil rights and anti-apartheid movements and in democracy movements in <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/poland">Poland</a> and Myanmar</span></div>
